{
  "_readme": [
    "Which i18n keys each committed screenshot family renders, and a fingerprint of",
    "their English values at capture time. `check-screenshot-freshness.mjs` recomputes",
    "these and fails when a string moves, so a screenshot cannot go stale unnoticed the",
    "way translations-hero-profile-card.png did (it showed 'RUNS AS' for six weeks after",
    "run_profiles.runs_as became 'Runs in this order', and shipped that way in v2.1.0).",
    "",
    "`sources` are scanned for static t(\"key\") literals, so a card that starts using a",
    "new string is covered automatically. `prefixes` cover the one thing that cannot be",
    "extracted: t(`vocab.${field}.${slug}`), the chip labels. The four fields named are",
    "the ones the cards pass to chipRow(), not a guess and not all 682 vocab.* keys.",
    "",
    "`keys` is generated. Re-record it with --update AFTER re-shooting, never before:",
    "updating without re-shooting is how the gate gets silently disarmed.",
    "",
    "The shots live at http://192.168.4.104:8123/hero-shots — 54 cards pinned one per",
    "language, so re-shooting is screenshots only. Set the language globe to Auto first;",
    "it outranks every per-card pin."
  ],
